        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4674940?u=e894487baedec3721978440377b195cd6f334e4b&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This plan captures our work in <strong>September 2025</strong>. This is a 4-week iteration. We will ship in <strong>early October</strong>. It is a continuation of the August plan without any additions. Although a 4-week iteration, we'll have only 1 dev week. The second week is reserved for planning and engineering conversations.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Endgame</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>September 29, 2025</strong>: Endgame begins</li>
<li><strong>October 3, 2025</strong>: Endgame done</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">The endgame details for this iteration are tracked <a href="https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3Aendgame-plan+milestone%3A%22September+2025%22">here</a>.</p>
